    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d198">

                <pb facs="0328" n="222" xml:id="pg222"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-09-03">September 3,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports that he is assured by the Chinese foreign office that it is
                    doing everything in its power to settle the Manchurian customs question
                    promptly.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
